{"title":"1995 AJHSME Problems/Problem 15","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/0/860388333a1c7a8db1269beb5138c35d9a784412.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100^\\text{th}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"39\" height=\"16\" /> digit to the right of the decimal point in the decimal form of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/d/1dd2a5513626ca625d252ba5d3ad4802e03e6613.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4/37$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"36\" height=\"18\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/1/6f1a17671c18e3984a2bb316ad865f0031e5188d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 0 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 1 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 2 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 7 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"330\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/3/6b35f5ea1c84038021e34a9ccb70748b4133b419.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{4}{37}=\\frac{12}{111}=\\frac{108}{999}=0.108108108...$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"270\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>Since this repeats every three digits, digit number x = digit number (x mod 3), and the 100th digit = (100 mod 3)th digit = 1st digit = <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/6/3b6dec1f0fd7cf547677400cab4810dffd023411.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{(B)}\\ 1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"51\" height=\"28\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME\" title=\"1995 AJHSME\">1995 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1995 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1995 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1995\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1995 AJHSME Problems/Problem 14\">Problem 14</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1995 AJHSME Problems/Problem 16\">Problem 16</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1995 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1995 AJHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"19